flowchart TD
    File[File path] --> Sniff[Detect content signature]
    Sniff --> Route{Detected extension}
    Route -->|json/jsonl/xml/yaml/yml| Structured{Structured records enabled?}
    Structured -->|yes| StructuredParse[Parse hierarchy and infer record boundaries]
    StructuredParse -->|records found| RecordLines[Labelled structured record lines]
    StructuredParse -->|parse failure or no record| TextLike[Text or markup fallback]
    Structured -->|no| TextLike
    Route -->|txt/log/config/etc.| TextLike
    Route -->|csv/tsv| Delimited[Delimited table extractor]
    Route -->|xlsx/xlsm/xls/xlsb/ods| Excel[Spreadsheet readers and fallbacks]
    Route -->|docx| Docx[python-docx]
    Route -->|pdf| Pdf[pypdf embedded text]
    Route -->|rtf| Rtf[striprtf]
    Route -->|eml/msg| Email[Email parser]
    Route -->|image| Image{--scan-images TRUE?}
    Image -->|yes| OCR[pytesseract OCR]
    Image -->|no| NoOCR[ocr_disabled]
